	"Name": "(CP) Upgraded Jars",
	"Author": "CyanFire",
	"Description": "Upgraded versions of the original Preserves Jars, with improved space efficiency. The Jars come in Copper which take a stack of 1-10 of the same item, Iron which takes 11-25, Gold which takes 26-50 and Iridium which takes 51-100.  If enabled in the config, there is also a Prismatic version which takes 101-200.\n<br />\n<br />This is meant to be a Content Patcher replacement for the Custom Farming Redux [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/4439]Mod[/url].   \n<br />\n<br />Based off of the PFM [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/5181]conversion[/url] by Fox536 with tweaks, fixes and improvements by myself.\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />Purchase the crafting recipe for them from Clint. The first tier becomes available when the vanilla jars are unlocked.\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />Fully compatible with 1.6 and doesn't rely on anything else other than Content Patcher, Extra Machine Config &amp; SMAPI.\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />Compatible with:\n<br />\n<br />[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/24842]Cornucopia Artisan Machines[/url]\n<br />[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/8684]Grapes of Ferngill[/url]\n<br />[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/9600]Visit Mount Vapius[/url]",
